## 示例：基础方块（带 ItemBlock）

```java
// blocks/MyBlock.java
public class MyBlock extends Block {
    public MyBlock() {
        super(Block.Properties.create(Material.STONE)
            .hardnessAndResistance(1.5f, 6.0f)
            .sound(SoundType.STONE)
        );
    }

    @Override
    public void onBlockPlacedBy(World world, BlockPos pos, BlockState state,
                                ILivingEntity placer, ItemStack stack) {
        // 方块放置时的逻辑
    }

    @Override
    public void onBlockDestroyedByPlayer(World world, BlockPos pos,
                                        BlockState state, PlayerEntity player) {
        // 方块被玩家破坏时的逻辑
    }
}
```

```java
// 注册（在 RegistryEvent.Register<Block> 中）
@SubscribeEvent
public void onBlocksRegistry(RegistryEvent.Register<Block> event) {
    event.getRegistry().register(
        MY_BLOCK.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_block"))
    );
}
```

```java
// ❌ 错误示例：没有 setRegistryName
event.getRegistry().register(new MyBlock()); // 没有注册名，无法引用
```

## 示例：带 TileEntity 的方块

```java
// blocks/MyTileEntityBlock.java
public class MyTileEntityBlock extends Block implements ITileEntityProvider {
    public MyTileEntityBlock() {
        super(Block.Properties.create(Material.WOOD));
    }

    @Override
    public TileEntity createNewTileEntity(World world, int meta) {
        return new MyTileEntity();
    }

    @Override
    public boolean onBlockActivated(World world, BlockPos pos, BlockState state,
                                   PlayerEntity player, Direction side,
                                   float hitX, float hitY, float hitZ) {
        // 右键交互逻辑
        return true;
    }
}
```

```java
// entities/MyTileEntity.java
public class MyTileEntity extends TileEntity implements ITickable {
    private int counter = 0;

    public MyTileEntity() {
        super(TileEntityTypeRegistry.MY_TILE_ENTITY.get());
    }

    @Override
    public void update() {
        counter++;
        if (counter % 20 == 0) {
            // 每秒执行一次
        }
    }

    @Override
    public void writeToNBT(NBTTagCompound compound) {
        super.writeToNBT(compound);
        compound.setInteger("counter", counter);
    }

    @Override
    public void readFromNBT(NBTTagCompound compound) {
        super.readFromNBT(compound);
        counter = compound.getInteger("counter");
    }
}
```

> 注意：`writeToNBT`/`readFromNBT` 中读取 NBT 是安全的，但你**不能**在这些方法中读取世界数据。
